{"id":"6fe99f795b84e645","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-thm-saturated-model.md","title":"Saturated Model","display":"thm-saturated-model — Saturated Model","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-saturated-model","aliases":["58-thm-saturated-model"],"display":"thm-saturated-model — Saturated Model","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-logic-complete-theory.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-model.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-saturated-model.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-saturated-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-saturated-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-saturated-model — Saturated Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7683c1dcbe3db03f\" href=\"?note=7683c1dcbe3db03f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-logic-complete-theory.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-logic-complete-theory.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"923884eb8fe4e61d\" href=\"?note=923884eb8fe4e61d\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-model.md\">../batch09/58-df-model.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a76b6d001d6983af\" href=\"?note=a76b6d001d6983af\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-saturated-model.md\">../batch02/58-df-saturated-model.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,\\Sigma\">\\(T,\\Sigma\\)</span>（一阶理论及其语言）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogicCompleteTheory}_S(T,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogicCompleteTheory}_S(T,\\Sigma)\\)</span>（完备理论谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7683c1dcbe3db03f\" href=\"?note=7683c1dcbe3db03f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-logic-complete-theory.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-logic-complete-theory.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,T,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,T,\\Sigma)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\)</span>（模型谓词与结构论域，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"923884eb8fe4e61d\" href=\"?note=923884eb8fe4e61d\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-model.md\">../batch09/58-df-model.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>（候选基数）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span>（正则基数谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SaturatedInLanguage}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SaturatedInLanguage}_S\\)</span>（固定语言的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-饱和谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"a76b6d001d6983af\" href=\"?note=a76b6d001d6983af\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-saturated-model.md\">../batch02/58-df-saturated-model.md</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}saturated\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcLogicCompleteTheory}_S(T,\\Sigma)\n\\land\\exists\\mathcal M\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,T,\\Sigma)\n\\land\\omega\\leq|\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)|\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land|\\Sigma|&lt;\\kappa\n\\land\\kappa^{&lt;\\kappa}=\\kappa\\right)\n\\to\\exists\\mathfrak A\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathfrak A,T,\\Sigma)\n\\land|\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)|=\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{SaturatedInLanguage}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\Sigma,\\kappa)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}saturated\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcLogicCompleteTheory}_S(T,\\Sigma)\n\\land\\exists\\mathcal M\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,T,\\Sigma)\n\\land\\omega\\leq|\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)|\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land|\\Sigma|&lt;\\kappa\n\\land\\kappa^{&lt;\\kappa}=\\kappa\\right)\n\\to\\exists\\mathfrak A\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathfrak A,T,\\Sigma)\n\\land|\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)|=\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{SaturatedInLanguage}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\Sigma,\\kappa)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-饱和性要求实现每个定义在大小小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 的参数集上的完备 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>-型。</li>\n<li>正则性保证少于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 个参数在长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 的构造链中最终同时出现；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa^{&lt;\\kappa}=\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa^{&lt;\\kappa}=\\kappa\\)</span> 控制待实现类型的数量。大小条件必须约束语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>，不能只写理论集合的基数。</li>\n<li>任意理论、任意基数上都存在恰为该基数的饱和模型是错误的。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","te